ull,{"className":"mt-3 text-lg leading-8 text-fg","children":"Most “landing page audit” tools do not audit conversions - they measure speed, behavior, or technical SEO. Of the 8 tools compared here, only Nebula checks 9 observable conversion conditions on the public page, and it is the only free option with no email gate. Those checks do not predict conversion from paid traffic. PageSpeed Insights is the right pick for the speed question alone; Hotjar and Crazy Egg for post-launch behavior; SEMrush and Screaming Frog for site-wide technical SEO. If your page loads fine but is not converting, start with Nebula - free, under 2 minutes, no signup."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"How we compared"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Each tool was evaluated against the job a founder actually has: you are spending money on ads, traffic arrives, and the page does not convert. We scored each tool on five questions - does it check conversion structure, does it require signup, does it need existing traffic, does it work on any public URL, and does it include a fix path. Pricing is from each vendor's public page as of August 2026; verify before deciding."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"The tools, ranked"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","div","Nebula",{"className":"rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between gap-4","children":["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":["Rank ","1"]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":["$","$L17",null,{"href":"/audit","className":"hover:underline","children":"Nebula"}]}],"$L18"]}]}]